
---
import DocsLayout from "../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocsLayout
	title="Loot Tables"
	description="Learn how Loot Containers determines the rewards players can receive."
>
	<div class="info-box">
		<strong>What are loot tables?</strong>
		<p>
			Loot tables define which items can be rewarded when a player opens
			a Loot Container. You can customize the available rewards, their
			rarities, and how many items can be awarded.
		</p>
	</div>

	<h2>How loot tables work</h2>

	<p>
		When a player opens a container, Loot Containers uses its assigned
		loot table to determine what rewards are available and which reward
		the player receives.
	</p>

	<div class="feature-grid">
		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Item Pools</h3>
			<p>Choose which items can appear as rewards in your loot tables.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Rarity Weights</h3>
			<p>Control how likely different rarity tiers are to be selected.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Item Count</h3>
			<p>Configure the minimum and maximum number of items awarded.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Reward Chances</h3>
			<p>Configure the chances associated with receiving rewards.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<h2>Rarity tiers</h2>

	<p>
		Loot Containers includes six rarity tiers. Each tier can have its own
		weight, allowing you to customize how frequently it appears.
	</p>

	<div class="rarity-list">
		<div class="rarity common">Common</div>
		<div class="rarity uncommon">Uncommon</div>
		<div class="rarity rare">Rare</div>
		<div class="rarity epic">Epic</div>
		<div class="rarity legendary">Legendary</div>
		<div class="rarity mythic">Mythic</div>
	</div>

	<h2>Item count ranges</h2>

	<p>
		You can configure a minimum and maximum item count for rewards.
		This lets you control how many items a player can receive from
		a container opening.
	</p>

	<h2>Reward chances</h2>

	<p>
		Reward chances let you control the probability of receiving rewards.
		These settings work alongside your loot table configuration to
		shape the overall reward experience.
	</p>

	<h2>Connecting loot tables to containers</h2>

	<p>
		Loot tables can be assigned to containers so different containers
		can provide different rewards. You can also configure container
		assignments to account for dimensions.
	</p>

	<div class="info-box">
		<strong>Keep in mind</strong>
		<p>
			Each player can receive a reward only once from an individual
			container. This helps prevent players from repeatedly claiming
			rewards from the same container.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="success-box">
		<strong>What's next?</strong>
		<p>
			Learn how the rarity system works and how each tier affects
			your loot table rewards.
		</p>
		<a href={`${base}docs/rarities/`}>Explore the Rarity System →</a>
	</div>

	<div class="page-navigation">
		<a href={`${base}docs/installation/`}>← Installation</a>
		<a href={`${base}docs/rarities/`}>Next: Rarity System →</a>
	</div>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
	.info-box,
	.success-box {
		padding: 18px 20px;
		margin: 22px 0;
		border: 1px solid rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: rgba(139, 220, 255, 0.07);
	}

	.info-box strong,
	.success-box strong {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 7px;
	}

	.info-box p,
	.success-box p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.success-box {
		border-color: rgba(243, 166, 232, 0.25);
		background: rgba(243, 166, 232, 0.07);
	}

	.feature-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 14px;
		margin: 22px 0;
	}

	.feature-card {
		padding: 18px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 8px;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.feature-card p {
		margin: 0;
		color: #a9a9bb;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	.rarity-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 10px;
		margin: 20px 0;
	}

	.rarity {
		padding: 13px 10px;
		text-align: center;
		font-weight: 700;
		border: 1px solid currentColor;
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
	}

	.common { color: #c4c4c4; }
	.uncommon { color: #65d58b; }
	.rare { color: #5bafff; }
	.epic { color: #c18aff; }
	.legendary { color: #eac66c; }
	.mythic { color: #ff65dc; }

	.page-navigation {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		margin-top: 35px;
		padding-top: 20px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
	}

	.page-navigation a,
	.success-box a {
		color: #a9dfff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.feature-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.rarity-list {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		}
	}
</style>
